<title>SINGAPORE: Wassall AP shares suspended for results.</title>
<headline>Wassall AP shares suspended for results.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trailer axle-maker Wassall Asia Pacific Ltd said on Tuesday its had asked the Stock of Exchange of Singapore (SES) to suspend its shares on Wednesday pending the announcement of its half year results for the six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>A statement detailing the request did not say when the results would be published.</p>
<p>Wassall AP is a unit of British diversified conglomerate Wassall Plc.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
